    ('95e422e4-a53f-4038-b260-1c5ef0d7e76f'::uuid, 'card_description', 'Devil''s Dyke is the remains of a prehistoric defensive ditch which lies at the east side of the village of Wheathampstead, Hertfordshire.', 'At Wheathampstead, Devil''s Dyke is a prehistoric ditch around 30 m wide and 12 m deep at its largest, generally agreed to have defended an Iron Age settlement of the Catuvellauni.', 'teaser-card-s024:95e422e4-a53f-4038-b260-1c5ef0d7e76f:card_description', 'teaser-card-s024 (teaser-card): teaser card, 179 characters, checked PASS, web-verified VERIFIED', '0ddcdaabe33043f21e644fac696aaaa6ba50c9839a46c343856e9fd07ee6c5fa|cf68164d907280bbeb3b0fba8fcbd3cdd03b16689606bae05c3345b122a89030|cf68164d907280bbeb3b0fba8fcbd3cdd03b16689606bae05c3345b122a89030', '[{"source": "lane WB run wb-ws-2026-09-27-05: writer teaser-wb-ws-2026-09-27-05-write-018", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-ws-2026-09-27-05/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "At Wheathampstead, Devil''s Dyke is a prehistoric ditch around 30 m wide and 12 m deep at its largest, generally agreed to have defended an Iron Age settlement of the Catuvellauni."}, {"source": "lane WB run wb-ws-2026-09-27-05: checker teaser-wb-ws-2026-09-27-05-check-018 (check), PASS", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-ws-2026-09-27-05/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "Devil''s Dyke is at Wheathampstead [S1]; it is a prehistoric ditch [S1]; it is around 30 m wide and 12 m deep at its largest [S8]; it is generally agreed to have been part of the defences of an Iron Age settlement [S3]; that settlement belonged to the Catuvellauni [S3]"}, {"source": "lane WB run wb-ws-2026-09-27-05: verifier teaser-wb-ws-2026-09-27-05-verify-053 (verify), VERIFIED", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-ws-2026-09-27-05/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "Devil''s Dyke is a prehistoric defensive ditch at Wheathampstead, Hertfordshire [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Devil''s_Dyke,_Hertfordshire]; It is around 30 m wide at its largest [SUPPORTED: h